Medical Devices Ordinance (MedDO) (MedDO)
SR 812.213 — Medical Devices Ordinance of 1 July 2020 (MedDO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2020/552]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 November 2023. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 1 July 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

:INFO
